                        


Item #:  SCP-5215

Object Class:  Euclid

Special Containment Procedures:  SCP-5215’s entrance is blocked by guards that are to be switched every 6 hours due to mental effects produced by SCP-5215. All guards are armed with tasers. There is a squared wall covering the area so that no human can approach SCP-5215.

Description:  SCP-5215 is a two-floor 15m x 10m wooden motel in the Malian part of Sahara Desert near the town of ██████. When a human being makes eye contact with the building, SCP-5215 becomes active. The human subject starts hearing their dead friends’ or relatives’ voices calling them from inside the motel. This attracts the human to enter although it is up to them to do so. There is no way to access the 2nd floor, what lies there is still a mystery. Inside, there are four seats, two doors and a counter. In the left door there is a small room with a chair which has limbless body with no inferior jaw and eyes.

The right door, makes the human feel an impulse to open it. Inside there is a dark hallway with no visible end to it.

Once the subject is inside the hallway, SCP-5215-1 steps in.

SCP-5215-1 is a tall humanoid with long fingers, no jaw or eyes and no skin.

SCP-5215-1 will start chasing them, and if they look behind, they will be unable to move and the creature will kill them.

Otherwise, if they start running from SCP-5215-1, they will run until they are exhausted or give up, no one has been able to get to the end of it, the hallway is most probably endless. The Class-D personnel who were inside the hallway reported seeing limbless, eyeless bodies attached to the ceiling.

Addendum:  It has been reported multiple times mails with the adress of SCP-5215 being sent to random houses. The mails contain human parts.



                    

                                    





            
    

                    



                    
                        
                            
